<% content_for :title, "Spendout — Everyday money, under control" %>
<% content_for :description, "A simple budget that turns your plans, currencies, and expenses into one answer: what is safe to spend today?" %>
<% content_for :hide_tabbar, true %>

<a href="#main-content" data-skip-link>Skip to content</a>

<main id="main-content" data-page="landing" data-size="xl">
  <section data-landing-hero aria-labelledby="landing-title">
    <div>
      <header data-hero-cybercat>
        <%= image_tag "cybercat.png", alt: "Cybercat", width: 100 %>
        <h1>Spendout</h1>
      </header>
      <h2 id="landing-title">Know what you can spend.<br>Everyday.</h2>
      <p>Spendout keeps your wallets, important plans, and everyday expenses in one calm instrument panel.</p>
      <div data-landing-actions>
        <%= link_to authenticated? ? "Open my budget" : "Try Spendout", authenticated? ? root_path : new_session_path,
              role: "button", data: { appearance: "keycap", intent: "primary" } %>
        <a href="#how-it-works">See how it works ↓</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" data-landing-chapter aria-labelledby="simple-title">
    <header>
      <h2 id="simple-title">Money, but simple.</h2>
      <p>A budget should answer questions, not create homework. Spendout keeps your wallets, important plans, and everyday expenses in one calm instrument panel.</p>
    </header>
    <div data-landing-steps>
      <article data-elevation="1">
        <header><span>01</span><h3>Add your money</h3></header>
        <main><p>Bring together cash, cards, bank accounts, or any other source you actually spend from.</p><div data-mini-source><span>◉</span><span>Everyday card</span><strong>$2,140</strong></div></main>
      </article>
      <article data-elevation="1">
        <header><span>02</span><h3>Protect your plans</h3></header>
        <main><p>Set aside rent, bills, and savings first. Plans guide you without blocking a real expense.</p><div data-mini-plan><span>Rent</span><strong>$1,200 / $1,200</strong><progress value="100" max="100">100%</progress></div></main>
      </article>
      <article data-elevation="1">
        <header><span>03</span><h3>Record what happened</h3></header>
        <main><p>Choose the source, optionally classify it, and move on. The dashboard recalculates immediately.</p><div data-mini-expense><span>Coffee</span><strong>−$4.50</strong><small>Today · Everyday card</small></div></main>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-landing-chapter aria-labelledby="control-title">
    <header>
      <h2 id="control-title">Your daily fuel gauge.</h2>
      <p>One glance tells you how much unplanned money is safe to spend today.</p>
    </header>
    <div data-control-layout>
      <article class="budget" data-landing-fuel>
        <%= render "shared/daily_gauge", amount: 74, currency_code: "USD", percentage: 68, demo: true %>
      </article>
      <div data-control-notes>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">🐷</span><div><h3>Unused money rolls forward</h3><p>Spend less today and tomorrow's safe remainder grows. Spend more and the meter adjusts.</p></div></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">🛡️</span><div><h3>Plans stay protected</h3><p>Spending assigned to rent, bills, or another planned category does not consume the everyday remainder.</p></div></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">🚦</span><div><h3>A signal, never a gate</h3><p>Over-planning produces a warning, not a lock. Spendout informs your decision and stays out of the way.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-landing-chapter aria-labelledby="currency-title">
    <header>
      <h2 id="currency-title">Currency polyglot.</h2>
      <p>Keep each source and plan in its real currency while the whole budget speaks one base currency.</p>
    </header>
    <div data-currency-story>
      <article data-elevation="1">
        <header><h3>Suggested where you are</h3><span data-status>TIMEZONE</span></header>
        <main><label><span>Search by name or code</span><input type="search" value="vnd" readonly tabindex="-1" aria-label="Example currency search"></label><div data-currency-example data-selected><span>🇻🇳</span><strong>VND</strong><span>Dong</span><small>Suggested</small></div><div data-currency-example><span>🇺🇸</span><strong>USD</strong><span>US Dollar</span></div></main>
      </article>
      <article data-elevation="1">
        <header><h3>A rate you control</h3><span data-status>SNAPSHOT</span></header>
        <main><p>Enter the selected-currency units per one base-currency unit. Spendout stores that quote with the record.</p><div data-rate-example><span>1 USD</span><span aria-hidden="true">=</span><strong>26,300 VND</strong></div><small>No external rate service. Historical values stay consistent.</small></main>
      </article>
      <article data-elevation="1">
        <header><h3>One useful total</h3><span data-status>BASE · USD</span></header>
        <main data-conversion-total><div><span>Cash</span><strong>₫2,630,000</strong></div><div><span>Everyday card</span><strong>$900</strong></div><hr><div><span>Total in base</span><strong>$1,000</strong></div></main>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="details" data-landing-chapter aria-labelledby="details-title">
    <header><h2 id="details-title">Fast when you know what you want.</h2><p>Friendly defaults for beginners. Short paths for everyone else.</p></header>
    <div data-detail-grid>
      <article><div><kbd>⇧</kbd><span>+</span><kbd>E</kbd></div><h3>Keyboard friendly</h3><p>Jump between sections and add an expense without reaching for the pointer.</p></article>
      <article><div><span>⌖</span><strong>VND</strong></div><h3>Currency suggested</h3><p>Your timezone brings the likely currency forward without silently choosing it.</p></article>
      <article><div><span>Aug 24</span><span>→</span><span>Aug 22</span></div><h3>Easy to correct</h3><p>Edit the amount, note, category, source, or occurrence date when reality changes.</p></article>
      <article><div><span>Rent</span><span>·</span><span>Deleted source</span></div><h3>History stays honest</h3><p>Removed sources and categories remain visible on the expenses that used them.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section data-landing-ownership aria-labelledby="ownership-title">
    <div><h2 id="ownership-title">Built to be self-hosted.</h2><p>Spendout is a compact Rails application currently deployed with Kamal. A simpler guided installation with ONCE is planned.</p><a href="https://github.com/spacepolice10/spendout">View the source on GitHub ↗</a></div>
    <aside data-deployment-terminal aria-label="Deployment terminal">
      <header><span aria-hidden="true">● ● ●</span><small>spendout@server:~</small></header>
      <div>
        <p><span>$</span> kamal deploy</p>
        <p><strong>✓</strong> Spendout is running</p>
        <p><span>$</span> once deploy spendout</p>
        <p><small>↳ planned: guided install + backups</small></p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <footer data-landing-footer>
    <div><strong>Spendout</strong><p>A quieter way to decide what is safe to spend.</p></div>
    <p><strong>ROADMAP</strong> · Reports · CLI access · Automatic sorting <small>— planned, not yet available</small></p>
    <%= link_to authenticated? ? "Open my budget" : "Try Spendout", authenticated? ? root_path : new_session_path, role: "button", data: { appearance: "keycap", intent: "primary" } %>
  </footer>
</main>
